Package: calmHLS
Title: Calculate DNA Methylation-Based Healthy Lifestyle Score (mHLS)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tanwei", "Yuan", email = "ytanwei@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes individual DNAm-based scores for smoking, alcohol, BMI,
  extracts diet-related CpGs, and then calculates the overall DNAm-based Healthy
  Lifestyle Score (mHLS) and domain-specific sub-scores using pre-trained coefficients.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: 
    stats
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
URL: https://github.com/TanweiY/calmHLS
BugReports: https://github.com/TanweiY/calmHLS/issues
